  + distinct logical adapter operation subject input/output profiles permit dependency and activation false expose every relevant meaning to ordered comparison and audit
  + complete A7 replay independent retained evidence strict canonical forms and capability-smuggling refusals reuse proven patterns while keeping new capability zero

